# 36. CONFLICTING EVIDENCE

Actively search for disagreement.

Do not only collect sources that support the same conclusion.

For important debates provide:

### Position A

Evidence.

### Position B

Evidence.

### Why the findings differ

### Context

### Balanced conclusion

This section is especially important for Master's-level academic work.

